    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Reerihii Bari Oo Ku Noqdeen Meeshoodii",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Yashuuca u yeedhay reer Ruubeen, iyo reer Gaad, iyo reer Manaseh badhkiis, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oo wuxuu ku yidhi, Waad xajiseen kulli wixii uu addoonkii Rabbiga oo Muuse ahaa idinku amray, oo codkaygana waad dhegaysateen oo waad yeesheen kulli wixii aan idinku amray. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waagaas ilaa maantadan la joogo walaalihiin kama aydnaan tegin, laakiinse waad xajiseen amarkii Rabbiga Ilaahiinna ah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo haatan Rabbiga Ilaahiinna ahu walaalihiin buu nasiyey, siduu markii hore kula hadlay; haddaba noqda, oo taga teendhooyinkiinnii, iyo dalkii hantida idiin ahaa, oo addoonkii Rabbiga oo Muuse ahaa idinka siiyey Webi Urdun shishadiisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiinse aad iyo aad u dadaala inaad yeeshaan amarkii iyo sharcigii uu addoonkii Rabbiga ee Muuse ahaa idinku amray, kuwaasoo ah inaad Rabbiga Ilaahiinna ah jeclaataan, oo aad ku socotaan jidadkiisa oo dhan, oo aad amarradiisa xajisaan, oo aad isaga aad u sii xajisataan, oo aad qalbigiinna oo dhan iyo naftiinna oo dhan ugu adeegtaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasuu Yashuuca u duceeyey oo iska diray, oo iyana waxay tageen teendhooyinkoodii.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo reer Manaseh badhkiis Muuse wuxuu dhaxal ka siiyey Baashaan dhexdeeda; laakiinse badhkii kale Yashuuca ayaa dal ka siiyey walaalahood dhexdooda meel Webi Urdun ka shishaysa oo xagga galbeed ka xigta. Oo weliba Yashuuca markuu iyagii iska diray, oo ay teendhooyinkoodii tageen, ayuu u duceeyey iyaga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oo intuu la hadlay ayuu ku yidhi, Teendhooyinkiinnii kula noqda maal badan, iyo lo' aad u tiro badan, iyo lacag, iyo dahab, iyo naxaas, iyo bir, iyo dhar aad u badan; oo boolidii cadaawayaashiinna laga helay walaalihiin la qaybsada.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa reer Ruubeen, iyo reer Gaad, iyo reer Manaseh badhkiis ayaa noqday, oo ka tegey reer binu Israa'iil oo joogay Shiiloh taasoo ku taal dalkii Kancaan, inay u kacaan dalkii Gilecaad, kaasoo ahaa dalkii hantidooda ahaa, ee ay ku hantiyeen amarkii Rabbigu Muuse u soo dhiibay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo markay yimaadeen gobolkii u dhowaa Webi Urdun oo ku yaalay dalkii Kancaan ayay reer Ruubeen, iyo reer Gaad, iyo reer Manaseh badhkiis Webi Urdun agtiisa ka dhiseen meel allabari oo muuq weyn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa reer binu Israa'iil waxay maqleen in la yidhi, Reer Ruubeen, iyo reer Gaad, iyo reer Manaseh badhkiis ayaa meel allabari ka dhisay darafka dalka Kancaan, meeshaas oo ah gobolka u dhow Webi Urdun oo ah dinaca ay leeyihiin reer binu Israa'iil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo markii reer binu Israa'iil ay taas maqleen ayaa shirkii reer binu Israa'iil oo dhammu ku ururay Shiiloh inay dagaal ugu baxaan iyaga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo reer binu Israa'iil waxay xagga reer Ruubeen, iyo reer Gaad, iyo reer Manaseh badhkiis oo joogay dalkii Gilecaad u direen Fiinexaas oo ahaa wiilkii wadaadkii ahaa Elecaasaar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxay isagii ku dareen toban amiir, oo amiirba wuxuu ka socday qabiilooyinka reer binu Israa'iil midkood, oo mid waluba wuxuu ahaa kii madaxda u ahaa reerahooda ku jira kumanyaalka reer binu Israa'iil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasay u yimaadeen reer Ruubeen, iyo reer Gaad, iyo reer Manaseh badhkiis oo joogay dalkii Gilecaad, oo intay la hadleen ayay ku yidhaahdeen, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shirkii Rabbiga oo dhammu sidan bay leeyihiin, Waa maxay xadgudubkan aad ku samayseen Ilaaha reer binu Israa'iil, idinkoo ka leexday inaad Rabbiga la socotaan, oo meel allabari dhistay, si aad maanta Rabbiga ugu caasiyowdaan? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Miyuu nagu yar yahay dembigii Fecoor oo aannan iska nadiifin ilaa maantadan la joogo in kastoo ay belaayo ku soo degtay shirka Rabbiga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "inaad maanta ka leexataan inaad Rabbiga la socotaan? Oo caasinimadii aad maanta Rabbiga ku caasiyowdeen aawadeed ayuu berrito ugu cadhoon doonaa shirka reer binu Israa'iil oo dhan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habase yeeshee, haddii dalkii hantidiinna ahaa aanu nadiif ahayn, de markaas u soo gudba dalka Rabbiga hantidiisa ah, oo uu taambuuggii Rabbigu ku dhex jiro, oo nala qayb qaata; laakiinse Rabbiga ha ku caasiyoobina, oo annagana ha nagu caasiyoobina, oo ha dhisina meel allabari oo aan ahayn tii Rabbiga Ilaaheenna ah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Caakaan ina Serax miyaanu ku xadgudbin alaabtii la nidray, oo taas daraaddeed miyaan cadho ugu dhicin shirkii reer binu Israa'iil oo dhan? Oo ninkaasu keligiis kuma uu dhiman dembigiisii.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa reer Ruubeen iyo reer Gaad iyo reer Manaseh badhkiis waxay u jawaabeen oo la hadleen kuwii madaxda u ahaa kumanyaalka reer binu Israa'iil, oo ku yidhaahdeen, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rabbiga ah Ilaaha ilaahyada, Rabbiga ah Ilaaha ilaahyadu wuu og yahay, oo reer binu Israa'iilna waa inuu ogaadaa, haddii taasu caasinimo tahay, ama xadgudub Rabbiga ka gees ah (maanta ha na badbaadin), ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo haddii aan meel allabari u dhisannay inaannu Rabbiga kaga leexanno, ama haddii aannu u dhisnay in lagu dul bixiyo qurbaan la gubo, ama qurbaan hadhuudh ah, ama in lagu dul bixiyo allabari ah qurbaanno nabaadiino, sidaas hadday tahay, Rabbiga qudhiisu ha na weyddiiyo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oo haddii aannan taas u samaynin feejignaan iyo sabab aawadood, annagoo leh, Waa dambe carruurtiinnu waxay la hadli doonaan carruurtayada, oo waxay ku odhan doonaan, Maxaa idinka galay Rabbiga Ilaaha u ah reer binu Israa'iil? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, Rabbigu wuxuu Webi Urdun ka dhigay soohdin inoo dhexaysa annaga iyo idinka, reer Ruubeen iyo reer Gaadow. Qayb kuma lihidin Rabbiga. Oo sidaasay carruurtiinnu carruurtayada uga joojin doonaan cabsida Rabbiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo sidaas daraaddeed waxaannu isnidhi, Haddaba aynu isu diyaarinno inaynu dhisanno meel allabari, oo aan lagu bixin qurbaan la gubo ama allabari, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
